Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfsclfs

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfsclfs/archive/refs/tags/20240430.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfsclfs-20240430-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfsclfs-20240430-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfsclfs-20240430-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsclfs-20240430-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsclfs1-20240430-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsclfs-devel-20240430-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfsclfs)
  /usr/bin/fsclfsinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/fsclfstest.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfsclfs.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfsclfs/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfsclfs/COPYING
